### Urban Ibile - Phase 1 auth requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
### Click "Send Request" above each block. Start the API first: `pnpm dev`.
### Requests marked @name store their response so later requests can reuse the tokens.

@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@email = ada@example.com
@password = Ankara-Velvet-2026!

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- CUSTOMER

### Register (mobile client: refresh token comes back in the body)
# @name register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "Ada Obi",
  "phone": "+234 801 234 5678",
  "acceptTerms": true,
  "client": "ios"
}

### Log in
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}", "client": "ios" }

### Who am I (uses the access token from "login")
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}

### Update profile (preferredLanguage: en | pcm)
PATCH {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Ada N. Obi", "preferredLanguage": "pcm" }

### Refresh (rotates: the old refresh token becomes invalid; sending it again revokes the session)
# @name refreshed
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.data.tokens.refreshToken}}" }

### Log out (revokes the session family)
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshed.response.body.data.tokens.refreshToken}}" }

### Verify email - copy the token from the MOCK EMAIL printed in the API terminal
POST {{base}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_MOCK_EMAIL" }

### Resend verification email
POST {{base}}/auth/resend-verification
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}

### Forgot password (always 202)
POST {{base}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}" }

### Reset password - token from the MOCK EMAIL in the API terminal
POST {{base}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_MOCK_EMAIL", "newPassword": "Lagos-Linen-Season-9" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- ADMIN
### Create the admin first in a terminal:  pnpm admin:create

@adminEmail = boss@example.com
@adminPassword = CHANGE_ME_TO_THE_PASSWORD_YOU_CHOSE

### Admin log in (refresh token is set as an httpOnly cookie; REST Client keeps cookies)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{base}}/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

### Admin me
GET {{base}}/admin/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}

### Admin refresh (uses the cookie)
POST {{base}}/admin/auth/refresh

### Admin change password
POST {{base}}/admin/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{adminPassword}}", "newPassword": "Another-Strong-Pass-77" }

### Admin log out (uses the cookie)
POST {{base}}/admin/auth/logout

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- AUDIENCE CHECK
### Customer token on an admin route -> 401
GET {{base}}/admin/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}
